<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Schrecksee from Auele — Äuele–Schrecksee complete mapped hike and return</name><desc>From the Äuele walking entrance, follow the marked mountain path to Schrecksee. The complete mapped hike continues to the Kirchendachsattel viewpoint before returning along the same full route to Äuele. The cited report describes the viewpoint as optional in its prose, but includes this real retrace in its sole complete map and downloadable tour. Route geometry: © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0; https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright and https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/. Changes: selected complete original walking-edge traversal for the cited Äuele hike; canonical display simplified. Dense walking coordinates remain original OSM positions.

